window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>It’s time to save the planet!... and fall in love.</p> <p></p> <p>Balance is the key to all life. Fires and floods herald renewal and new growth… in moderation. But when happens when the balance is gone and natural disasters reign unchecked?</p> <p></p> <p>The Elemental Men have us covered! The living embodiment of water, fire, air, earth, and the essence of life itself, their job is to bring balance back. They’ve had more lives than anyone can imagine, and their mission is to save the world. There’s no time for love.</p> <p></p> <p>But this incarnation, things will be different…</p>"; 
